== General Information ==

Crafted Armor is a mid-level [[Warrior]]-specific armor set obtained through quests offered by [[Shakrn Meadowgreen]] and [[Ulan Meadowgreen]] in [[Southern Karana]].

Each piece requires one or more gems and an additional dropped item. The required components come from several zones throughout classic Norrath.

Shakrn creates the Vambraces, Boots, Gauntlets, and Helm. Ulan creates the Pauldron, Greaves, Bracer, and Breastplate.

== Rewards ==

{{Gear Set
|Crafted Breastplate
|Crafted Plate Boots
|Crafted Vambraces
|Crafted Gauntlets
|Crafted Bracers
|Crafted Greaves
|Crafted Helm
|Crafted Pauldron
}}

== Walkthrough ==

Talk to [[Shakrn Meadowgreen]] at 160, -2217 or [[Ulan Meadowgreen]] at 126, -2177 in [[Southern Karana]].

For each armor piece, collect the following items.

